    {
      "endSeconds": 12.3,
      "index": 0,
      "sceneId": "title",
      "startSeconds": 0.25,
      "text": "Bottom line: use Copilot Studio as a governed agent platform, moving from business intent to useful action while funding workflows that merit scale, with rigor."
    },
    {
      "endSeconds": 25.475,
      "index": 1,
      "sceneId": "managed-build",
      "startSeconds": 12.85,
      "text": "Copilot Studio is a low-code studio for building and managing agents. Teams create agents, workflows and agent flows tied to business data, systems and work channels."
    },
    {
      "endSeconds": 38.15,
      "index": 2,
      "sceneId": "orchestrate-choices",
      "startSeconds": 26.025,
      "text": "Generative orchestration is the decision layer. It lets an agent choose topics, tools, knowledge or other agents, ask for missing input, and then compose the response."
    },
    {
      "endSeconds": 52.45,
      "index": 3,
      "sceneId": "tools-execute",
      "startSeconds": 38.7,
      "text": "Tools are where intent turns into action. Govern connectors, agent flows, prompts, REST APIs, MCP and computer use for both modern apps and legacy screens under policy."
    },
    {
      "endSeconds": 67.45,
      "index": 4,
      "sceneId": "govern-platform",
      "startSeconds": 53.0,
      "text": "Scale only with enterprise controls attached. Data policies, audit logs, Agent 365, Entra identities, spend controls and evaluations keep the platform managed at scale."
    }
